stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Closed
  Closed --> Loading: Open, reset query and kind
  Loading --> Ready: Admit independent sections
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read rejects
  Ready --> Ready: Change kind or query, reset active index
  Ready --> Ready: Arrow keys select current results
  Unavailable --> Unavailable: Filter pages or show no matches
  Unavailable --> Loading: Retry
  Ready --> Loading: Retry partial snapshot, discard records
  Loading --> Loading: Change query or kind
  Ready --> Closed: Enter navigates or Escape closes
  Unavailable --> Closed: Close
  Loading --> Closed: Close before read settles
  Closed --> Closed: Ignore late read completion
  Ready --> Closed: Session invalidation clears recents
